{"values": {"session_id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a", "messages": [{"content": "你好，我准备好了，请开始面试。", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:0"}, {"content": "你好，我是本次后端岗位一面面试官。接下来我们主要通过对话交流，你可以先做一个简短的自我介绍，重点说说你的教育背景、相关项目或工作经历，以及你认为比较熟悉的技术方向。", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 97, "prompt_tokens": 241, "total_tokens": 338, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 54, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 97}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 241}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-057184d9-c4d6-9c0c-b97e-34b446158efa", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162ba-50ff-7c01-865c-e63a6581f123-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 241, "output_tokens": 97, "total_tokens": 338, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 54}}}, {"content": "你好我是郭子恒，擅长python", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:1"}, {"content": "了解。既然你擅长 Python，在开发后端服务时，你更倾向于使用哪个 Web 框架（比如 Django、Flask 或 FastAPI），主要出于什么考虑？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 211, "prompt_tokens": 254, "total_tokens": 465, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 171, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 211}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 254}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-0cf0e077-67b8-9b30-9647-147854c707d4", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162ba-b8c7-74d0-a361-d63e7e5ef774-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 254, "output_tokens": 211, "total_tokens": 465, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 171}}}, {"content": "fastapi吧，比较快", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:2"}, {"content": "FastAPI 的“快”很大程度上得益于其对异步编程的支持。你能简单说说，在 Python 中处理 I/O 密集型任务（比如查询数据库或调用外部接口）时，`async/await` 机制是如何提升并发能力的吗？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 356, "prompt_tokens": 311, "total_tokens": 667, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 301, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 356}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 311}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-0fa1edff-b242-944e-8847-f9253a3ca1ec", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162bb-8c7b-7352-956d-2090a2da73c6-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 311, "output_tokens": 356, "total_tokens": 667, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 301}}}, {"content": "异步或者说并发函数能在调用接口等待返回的过程中，去调用和进行其他的io任务", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:3"}, {"content": "你提到的“等待 I/O 时执行其他任务”是异步的核心收益。那在 FastAPI 中，如果某个 `async` 函数里不小心执行了耗时的同步 CPU 计算，比如复杂算法或大量数据处理，会对事件循环和其他请求造成什么影响？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 184, "prompt_tokens": 395, "total_tokens": 579, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 123, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 184}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 395}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-82ce07a9-95ca-98aa-a9ca-1a775c14c0cc", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162bc-ef6d-76c3-8f88-869d6bc8a99b-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 395, "output_tokens": 184, "total_tokens": 579, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 123}}}, {"content": "会造成这个函数堵塞，长时间没有返回结果，但是对其他的请求来说，如果不是线性需求的不会有什么影响", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:4"}, {"content": "这里需要澄清一点：Python 的异步事件循环是单线程的，一旦在 `async` 函数中执行长时间同步 CPU 计算，阻塞的其实是整个事件循环，导致其他并发请求也无法被调度，而不仅仅是当前这一个函数没有返回。\n\n那在 FastAPI 中，你会用什么方式来避免这种阻塞？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 384, "prompt_tokens": 489, "total_tokens": 873, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 312, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 384}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 489}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-e229fb66-5d55-90aa-b87e-2f45596401e2", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162c0-321d-7310-a2ca-95ea2eeba0f4-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 489, "output_tokens": 384, "total_tokens": 873, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 312}}}, {"content": "这个我不太了解", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:5"}, {"content": "没关系，我们换个角度：如果一个接口里确实需要执行耗时的同步 CPU 计算，你会考虑把它放到哪里去处理？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 217, "prompt_tokens": 576, "total_tokens": 793, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 187, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 217}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 576}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-83531e0f-0259-93ab-bc8f-f69c1b60349e", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162c0-8353-7750-909f-d19cf351a0df-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 576, "output_tokens": 217, "total_tokens": 793, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 187}}}, {"content": "哪里指的是？", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {}, "type": "human", "name": null, "id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a:human:6"}, {"content": "我说的“哪里”是指：除了直接在 `async` 函数里跑同步计算之外，你有没有听说过可以借助**线程池**（如 `run_in_executor`）或者**进程池**来执行这类任务，从而避免阻塞事件循环？", "additional_kwargs": {"refusal": null}, "response_metadata": {"token_usage": {"completion_tokens": 175, "prompt_tokens": 620, "total_tokens": 795, "completion_tokens_details": {"accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "audio_tokens": null, "reasoning_tokens": 120, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 175}, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 0, "image_tokens": null, "text_tokens": 620}}, "model_provider": "openai", "model_name": "qwen3.8-flash", "system_fingerprint": null, "id": "chatcmpl-d0fdc02a-8a9f-97a2-9471-1f0d98f52404", "finish_reason": "stop", "logprobs": null}, "type": "ai", "name": null, "id": "lc_run--01a162c0-e530-7122-a263-c0e3954c8abd-0", "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 620, "output_tokens": 175, "total_tokens": 795, "input_token_details": {"cache_read": 0}, "output_token_details": {"reasoning": 120}}}], "chat_round": 7, "candidate_config": {"language": "zh-CN", "education": "本科", "position": "后端面试官", "resume": null}, "interviewer_config": {"role_identity": "后端面试官", "role_responsibilities": "追问"}, "status": "active", "last_activity": 1792658174.1302207}, "next": [], "config": {"configurable": {"thread_id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a", "checkpoint_ns": "", "checkpoint_id": "1f1cdf3a-43ba-63df-801d-f7a3d62f7045"}}, "metadata": {"source": "update", "step": 29, "parents": {}}, "created_at": "2026-10-22T08:36:14.131503+00:00", "parent_config": {"configurable": {"thread_id": "05d338e0-a2f3-457e-ad3a-9053bba8eb0a", "checkpoint_ns": "", "checkpoint_id": "1f1cdf3a-43b7-61bd-801c-98afe2117922"}}, "tasks": [], "interrupts": []}